/
 These are the demo keys used with Ariel OS:

 The OS has the tools to do the proper thing of having per-device keys
 generated in it and provisioning it with the owner's public key, but the ESP32
 (and also native) platforms don't yet support the storage abstraction needed
 for this.
/
